*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0007
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-03-18 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 619
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0007.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    *> DAYS PAYMENT IS LATE
    05 DPD-DAYS           PIC 9(3).
    *> STATEMENT AMOUNT DUE
    05 STMT-DUE-AMT       PIC 9(7)V99.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 LATE-CHARGE        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM ASSESS-PENALTY
    DISPLAY "LATE-CHARGE=" LATE-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
ASSESS-PENALTY.
    EVALUATE DPD-DAYS
        *> EARLY LATE PAYMENT FEE - LIMIT 22 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN 1 THRU 15
            MOVE 25 TO LATE-CHARGE
        *> LATE PAYMENT FEE - LIMIT 15 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN 16 THRU 30
            MOVE 50 TO LATE-CHARGE
        *> SERIOUSLY LATE PAYMENT PENALTY - LIMIT 749 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN 31 THRU 999
            COMPUTE LATE-CHARGE = STMT-DUE-AMT * 0.05
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0 TO LATE-CHARGE
    END-EVALUATE.
